{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38920","headline":"依韵次同年张曙先辈见寄之什 · 杜荀鹤","name":"依韵次同年张曙先辈见寄之什","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天上诗名天下传，引来齐列玉皇前。\n大仙录後头无雪，至药成来竈绝烟。\n笑蹑紫云金作阙，梦抛尘世铁爲船。\n九华山叟惊凡骨，同到蓬莱岂偶然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38920.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38920","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}